{
  "$comment": "Hand-maintained from the repos.yaml entry (E9-P2 trivial-tier) while blocked-until-jake-ok: onboard refuses public repos without jake_ok. Re-run onboard after Jake OKs. Guards and governance-enforce are built-in (not listed; governance_enforce turns on the diff gate); provenance-emit waits on guards + governance-enforce + all foundations (O1 barrier: green builds only).",
